CM_ "Simulated vehicle for the Lexus Head Unit project. This vehicle is INVENTED: no message, identifier or signal here describes the 2013 Lexus GS350 or any real car. It exists to exercise the DBC decoder (REQ-005): little and big endian, signed and unsigned, 1 to 32 bits, byte-boundary crossings, scale and offset, a 4-byte message and a 29-bit identifier.";
CM_ BO_ 2566844672 "29-bit (extended) identifier 0x18FEF100; bit 31 of the DBC identifier marks it as extended.";
